  "description": "Frozen compatibility behavior (PYTHON_BINDING.md §7.1): model-carried reflection is written and classified as generated, and an optional index left by an earlier write is not deleted when its collection later becomes empty — the stale file stays in SHA256SUMS and is reclassified as authored.",
